{"version":1,"key":"card:674","content":{"id":674,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cc6ce68e-4bcb-4680-8cd7-a71f9f362035","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在浏览器中，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"script"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"img"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"video"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"audio"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等标签引用跨域资源时，出于安全考虑，浏览器会将此资源视为不透明（Opaque），所谓的不透明通俗讲就是“只可远观而不可亵玩”，即脚本可以执行，图片可以显示，音视频可以播放，但是无法通过脚本获取到内容："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"96abc25a-b197-4de6-8e96-9ff35a0fe74b","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"963e3bd9-8a20-40bf-8ab9-c48d288b8a8b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dffba721-a5b2-4593-9baf-b585d64e79f2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"跨域脚本无法计算 "},{"type":"content-link","contentId":5141,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":675,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"b206414a-00c3-44cd-83ad-7cf33acce439","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"integrity"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，无法验证资源完整性"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7a5995af-dff4-4cbd-adcc-fd2d21ac938e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"abf1861c-04ac-44a0-a503-f9d61a9a9b73","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"脚本执行报错也只能捕获到毫无意义的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"\"Script error.\""},{"type":"formatted","text":"，无法获取到调用栈、行号等信息"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3c846237-3614-4dce-956a-17074d079823","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"382b1425-41c6-4403-8f73-a9f23cbf02dc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一旦将跨域图片通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"drawImage"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 画在 Canvas 上，此画布就会被标记为污染（tainted），而一旦画布收到污染，那么就无法通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"getImageData"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 获取到画布内容，也无法通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"toDataURL"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"toBlob"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 导出为图片"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9a9c9137-6cf0-4796-b00b-8428cf7593fa","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"640cb184-ced9-470c-843f-1be15ad68ba1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"视频也是，如果尝试通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"drawImage"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 将跨域视频的当前帧绘制到画布上，画布也会被标记为污染，无法获取到画布数据，也无法进行导出"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b7a29cf4-babd-46c3-8bbf-cf370065df88","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ebbeea90-0740-4ceb-abb6-628038a72b57","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于跨域音频，也无法获取到二进制数据，无法进行音频分析，通过 Web Audio API 可以创建音频源，但是只能输出到扬声器，如果尝试输入到分析节点（AnalyserNode），得到的数据全部都是 0"}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d4686